Our invitation is really something.

00:38:51.760 --> 00:38:54.080
A lot of people came in these days.

00:38:54.560 --> 00:38:57.040
The swordsmen can't surrender to the demons.

00:38:57.360 --> 00:38:58.840
Most of them are hiding.

00:38:59.080 --> 00:39:00.240
They're waiting for us to summon them.

00:39:01.640 --> 00:39:02.440
Just wait.

00:39:02.760 --> 00:39:04.440
Someone will continue to vote.

00:39:04.760 --> 00:39:05.440
Sure.

00:39:05.840 --> 00:39:07.520
This brat wants to turn us

00:39:07.760 --> 00:39:08.880
into their big rear.

00:39:09.080 --> 00:39:10.360
You wish.

00:39:14.760 --> 00:39:15.480
Guys.

00:39:16.160 --> 00:39:17.040
Li is here.

00:39:20.640 --> 00:39:22.040
How is the situation at the fortress?

00:39:22.320 --> 00:39:24.200
Qinglong Fortress is no longer the original Qinglong Fortress.

00:39:24.560 --> 00:39:26.080
Qinglong Fortress has become a Japanese fortress.

00:39:26.360 --> 00:39:28.040
We stored a lot of weapons and ammunition in our fortress.

00:39:28.360 --> 00:39:29.960
The surrounding walls are reinforced.

00:39:30.600 --> 00:39:31.640
He Xiaopian.

00:39:33.320 --> 00:39:35.000
What happened to He Xiaopian? Tell us.

00:39:36.080 --> 00:39:37.560
He Xiaopian took his men

00:39:37.800 --> 00:39:38.880
to Tianyuan Zhenghong.

00:39:39.160 --> 00:39:41.000
He killed those who didn't surrender.

00:39:41.320 --> 00:39:42.920
We have no choice.

00:39:49.280 --> 00:39:50.040
Li.

00:39:50.400 --> 00:39:51.680
This is your home.

00:39:51.960 --> 00:39:53.120
Stay here

00:39:53.480 --> 00:39:55.560
Uncle Liu, please arrange it.

00:39:55.920 --> 00:39:56.720
Okay.

00:39:57.800 --> 00:39:59.280
Li, come with me.

00:40:13.000 --> 00:40:13.760
Bao.

00:40:14.720 --> 00:40:16.000
I need to go back to Qinglong Fortress.

00:40:17.920 --> 00:40:18.720
No.

00:40:19.000 --> 00:40:19.400
That place

00:40:19.600 --> 00:40:21.320
has become their camp.

00:40:21.800 --> 00:40:23.120
I won't go from the front.

00:40:23.640 --> 00:40:24.080
Did you forget?

00:40:24.280 --> 00:40:25.160
There's a secret tunnel over there.

00:40:25.360 --> 00:40:26.640
Uncle half a kilo is there too.

00:40:27.520 --> 00:40:28.720
I have to go back and have a look.

00:40:28.960 --> 00:40:30.560
Okay, don't go alone.

00:40:30.840 --> 00:40:31.920
I'll go with you.

00:40:32.240 --> 00:40:33.160
You can't leave.

00:40:33.600 --> 00:40:36.120
Many brothers will come in these days.

00:40:36.400 --> 00:40:37.600
You're the backbone here.

00:40:38.080 --> 00:40:39.120
If you leave,

00:40:42.040 --> 00:40:43.120
if you leave?

00:40:45.080 --> 00:40:46.080
Since you've made up your mind,

00:40:46.360 --> 00:40:48.080
no matter what I say, I can't stop you.

00:40:48.400 --> 00:40:50.080
We've been through so much together.

00:40:50.480 --> 00:40:52.680
You must know what to do now.

00:40:53.000 --> 00:40:54.160
But you have to promise me

00:40:54.760 --> 00:40:55.800
be careful.

00:40:56.800 --> 00:40:57.680
I will.

